<title>CANADA: Moore Corp unit to buy software business.</title>
<headline>Moore Corp unit to buy software business.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Corp said on Tuesday its wholly owned NEPS Inc unit agreed to buy the Documetrix 1200 Print-on-Demand line of business from Universal Systems Inc (US) for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The purchase will include all rights to Documetrix 1200 software, code, documentation and current customer base.</p>
<p>Documetrix 1200 is a LAN-based distributed print production management system.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
